            "text": "Thanks @99128. I've reviewed the client survey. The questions are a good start, but they feel a bit generic. We need to be more specific to get actionable feedback. For example, instead of 'Did you enjoy your visit?', we should ask 'How would you rate the on-site experience in our office (1-5)?' and 'What is one thing we could do to improve your next visit?'. This will give us concrete data.",
